<Layout title="Drylining Penicuik | Partition Walls &amp; Ceilings Contractors" description="Professional drylining contractors in Penicuik. Expert partition walls, suspended ceilings, and plasterboard installation for Penicuik, Midlothian, and the wider EH26 postcode region. Free quotes." canonical="/areas/penicuik/" schema={schema}>
  <section style="position:relative;min-height:400px;display:flex;align-items:center;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1a1a2e 0%,#16213e 100%);overflow:hidden;"> <img src="/images/hero-main.jpg" alt="Drylining services in Penicuik and Midlothian" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;opacity:0.25;"> <div class="container" style="position:relative;z-index:1;text-align:center;padding:60px 20px;"> <nav style="font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.70);margin-bottom:12px;"> <a href="/" style="text-decoration:none;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.70);">Home</a> / <a href="/areas/" style="text-decoration:none;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.70);">Areas</a> / <span style="color:#ffffff;">Drylining in Penicuik</span> </nav> <h1 style="font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,44px);font-weight:800;color:#ffffff;margin-bottom:14px;line-height:1.15;">Drylining in Penicuik</h1> <p style="font-size:17px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:700px;margin:0 auto;line-height:1.6;">CSCS-accredited drylining contractors delivering partition walls, suspended ceilings, and plasterboard across Penicuik, Midlothian, and the wider EH26 postcode region.</p> </div> </section> <section class="section"><div class="container" style="max-width:900px;"> <div style="padding:24px;margin-bottom:24px;border-left:4px solid var(--primary);background:var(--white);border-radius:var(--radius);border:1px solid var(--border);"> <p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;color:var(--text);"><strong>TL;DR:</strong> Drylining Penicuik provides drylining, partition walls, and suspended ceilings across Penicuik (EH26), Midlothian, and the wider area. Experienced with historic mill town properties, new residential developments, and commercial refurbishments along the Water of Leith.</p> </div> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Drylining Services in Penicuik</h2> <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Penicuik is a historic burgh in Midlothian, situated approximately 7 miles south-west of Edinburgh city centre along the Water of Leith. The EH26 postcode covers the town centre with its distinctive Victorian mill architecture, surrounding residential areas, and nearby villages including Bonnyrigg and Dalkeith. Penicuik has a population of around 15,000 and has undergone significant residential development in recent years, from the conversion of former printing works buildings along the river to new build estates on the town's fringes. As a popular commuter town for Edinburgh, Penicuik has seen steady growth in both residential refurbishment and new commercial developments, creating consistent demand for quality drylining services across the Midlothian area.</p> <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">The area offers a distinctive mix of projects for our drylining team — from the careful internal refurbishment of Victorian mill buildings that once housed Penicuik's famous printing industry to new build residential developments on the town's outskirts. We cover the entire EH26 postcode and surrounding Midlothian areas, serving everything from single-room domestic projects in period properties to larger commercial fit-outs along the Water of Leith business corridor. All work is carried out to Scottish Building Standards compliant with all relevant sections.</p> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">What We Do in Penicuik</h2> <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Our Penicuik crew handles everything from Victorian mill building conversions to new build pre-completion drylining — covering partition walls, suspended ceilings, and fire-rated wall systems across the EH26 postcode and Midlothian.</p> <ul style="list-style:disc;padding-left:1.5rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;font-size:1.0625rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;"> <li><strong>Mill building conversions</strong> — Internal wall insulation, room conversions, and partition walls in Penicuik's former Victorian printing works and mill buildings along the Water of Leith</li> <li><strong>New build drylining</strong> — Pre-completion drylining for residential developments on the outskirts of Penicuik and surrounding Midlothian areas</li> <li><strong>Commercial fit-outs</strong> — Office refurbs, retail units, and hospitality venues along Penicuik town centre and Water of Leith business areas</li> <li><strong>Fire-rated walls</strong> — Multi-storey residential and commercial buildings requiring Scottish Building Standards Section 2 (Fire) compliance</li> <li><strong>Suspended ceilings</strong> — Commercial premises, offices, and new build apartments across Midlothian</li> <li><strong>Acoustic partitions</strong> — Residential properties and mixed-use developments in Penicuik and surrounding areas</li> </ul> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Areas of Penicuik We Cover</h2> <ul style="list-style:disc;padding-left:1.5rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;font-size:1.0625rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;"> <li>Penicuik town centre (EH26)</li> <li>Water of Leith corridor and former mill buildings</li> <li>Burnmouth Road and Penicuik Industrial Estate</li> <li>Springfields area (EH26)</li> <li>Penicuik Glen and Midlothian Retail Park</li> <li>Craigmillar Park and Penicuik South</li> <li>Dalkeith (EH22) — 5 minutes via A709</li> <li>Bonnyrigg (EH19) — 8 minutes via A68</li> <li>Newtongrange (EH22) — 10 minutes via A709</li> <li>Midlothian area generally</li> </ul> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Penicuik Building Regulations &amp; Planning</h2> <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Penicuik falls under <strong>Midlothian Council</strong> for building standards and planning. The town centre contains numerous Category B and C listed buildings, particularly the former printing works along the Water of Leith that are characteristic of Penicuik's industrial heritage. Internal structural alterations in listed buildings require listed building consent from the council. We work closely with clients, architects, and the council's building standards department to ensure every project — from a simple room partition in a Victorian mill conversion to a commercial fit-out in a new build — is fully compliant with Scottish Building Standards and any additional conservation requirements.</p> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Why Choose Us for Penicuik Projects</h2> <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">As an Edinburgh-based drylining team, we have extensive experience working across Midlothian, including Penicuik, Dalkeith, and Bonnyrigg. We understand the unique character of Penicuik — from its historic Water of Leith mills to the growing residential developments on the town's fringes. Our crew is familiar with Scottish Building Standards and the particular requirements of working in a historic Scottish burgh with a rich industrial heritage. Whether you need drylining for a listed mill building conversion in Penicuik centre, a new build project, or a commercial refurbishment, our team delivers quality work on time and within budget.</p> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Related Services</h2> <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(180px,1fr));gap:10px;margin-bottom:1.5rem;"> <a href="/services/partition-walls/" style="text-decoration:none;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--white);border-radius:6px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--text);">Partition Walls</a> <a href="/services/fire-rated-drylining/" style="text-decoration:none;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--white);border-radius:6px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--text);">Fire-Rated Drylining</a> <a href="/services/acoustic-drylining/" style="text-decoration:none;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--white);border-radius:6px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--text);">Acoustic Drylining</a> <a href="/services/refurbishment-drylining/" style="text-decoration:none;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--white);border-radius:6px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--text);">Refurbishment Drylining</a> </div> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Nearby Areas</h2> <ul style="list-style:disc;padding-left:1.5rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;font-size:1.0625rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;"> <li><a href="/areas/dalkeith/" style="color:var(--primary);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">Dalkeith</a> — 5 minutes via A709</li> <li><a href="/areas/edinburgh/" style="color:var(--primary);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">Edinburgh</a> — 20 minutes via A709</li> <li><a href="/areas/bonnyrigg/" style="color:var(--primary);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">Bonnyrigg</a> — 8 minutes via A68</li> <li><a href="/areas/newtongrange/" style="color:var(--primary);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">Newtongrange</a> — 10 minutes via A709</li> </ul> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Get a Free Penicuik Quote</h2> <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:2rem;">We offer free, no-obligation site visits and written quotes for all drylining projects across Penicuik. Call us or fill in our quick form.</p> <div style="margin-top:2rem;text-align:center;"> <a href="/get-quote/" class="btn btn-primary" style="font-size:1.0625rem;padding:1rem 2.5rem;">Get a Free Penicuik Quote</a> <a href="tel:08008203090" class="btn btn-secondary" style="font-size:1.0625rem;padding:1rem 2.5rem;border:2px solid var(--primary);background:transparent;color:var(--primary);margin-left:0.5rem;">FREEPHONE 0800 820 3090</a> </div> </div></section>  
</Layout>